						710640801
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang"
				},
				{
					"id": 710640801,
					"content": "I've heard it said that the Cup of Commons will regain its dignity someday, even if it is obtained by bandits and crooks, or becomes a lowly guest at a humble table... But what does that even mean?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
